# ── Scratch / frame output ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# work/ is scratch: render frames, probes, staging. Only the live-session model and the
# session journals are kept.
work/*
!work/RETOPO_clyffy.blend
!work/bl_journal.jsonl
!work/bl_events.jsonl
archive/Clyffy_Avatar/work/*
!archive/Clyffy_Avatar/work/BUILD_LOG.md
!archive/Clyffy_Avatar/work/face_ab/
!archive/Clyffy_Avatar/work/ref_motion/
!archive/Clyffy_Avatar/work/voice/
archive/Clyffy_Avatar/work/voice/*
!archive/Clyffy_Avatar/work/voice/README.md
!archive/Clyffy_Avatar/work/voice/SAMPLES.md
!archive/Clyffy_Avatar/work/voice/tts_report.json
archive/Clyffy_Avatar/work/ref_motion/src/

